-- **Its twin, and the measurement is that this one is refused** (MS11 phase
-- 300): the same consult with the same block, and the rule that writes `LC` is
-- written after it. The base is fetched and `Lang` is in the session, and the
-- rule is still refused — which is what makes the block a frame.
rule base scoped-borrows-after where

consult test.modules.Lends where
  rule inside :- do
    say "inside"

open A

rule describe LC[app]`( ${f} ${a} )` :- do
  say "an application"
